><center><a href="user.php?op=userinfo&uname=Drach"><b>Drach</b></a><br>10/13/2002 3:00:01 am</center><br><center><a href="user.php?op=userinfo&uname=tanidob"><b>tanidob</b></a><br>10/13/2002 2:55:45 am</center><br><center><a href="user.php?op=userinfo&uname=Wilin"><b>Wilin</b></a><br>10/13/2002 2:53:57 am</center><br><center><b>Anonymous</b><br>10/13/2002 2:47:28 am</center><br></font></font></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><br><img src="images/pix.gif" border="0" width="150" height="1"></td><td>&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td width="100%" valign="top"><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" bgcolor="000000" width="100%"><tr><td><table border="0" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="1" width="100%"><tr><td bgcolor="000000" background="themes/0ri0n/images/cellpic1.gif"><b><a class="pn-title" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=news&amp;file=article&amp;sid=29&amp;mode=thread&amp;order=0&amp;thold=0">We've been busy dying</a></b><br></font></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="000000"><font class="tiny">Posted by <b>Tiberinus Maximus</b> on Sunday, October 06, 2002 - 09:16 AM PST (5 Reads)<br><br>We've been working on killing Gozzrem - new mob for us, a much harder, longer fight than ones we have done.   So far, with about 26 people 55%, 45% and 40% is all we have been able to get him down to.   Just need more DPS it seems - we have the fight figured out just gotta kill him in 8 minutes or less now (Hi Rogues apply within hehe - Oh yeah Wizzies get DB please thanks).<br />
<br />
There have been a few other mobs we wanted to go after but when we checked to see if they were up someone was bashing them.   The race is fun of course.<br />
<br />
Last night we managed to go into Hate after some cash and maybe a ranger epic item and found Innoruuk up.   Never killed him and we wanted to - after all we hate his plane.   So, we promptly handed him his ass.   He is one UGLY *****.   Reminds me of Zumum:<br />
<br />
<img src=http://www.sosguild.com/images/news/innoruuk.jpg><br><br>
<br><br></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="000000" align="left"><font class="content">comments? <a class="pn-normal" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=recommend_us&amp;file=index&amp;req=FriendSend&amp;sid=29"><img src="images/global/friend.gif" border="0" alt="Send this story to a friend"></a> <a class="pn-normal" href="print.php?sid=29"><img src="images/global/print.gif" border="0" alt="Printer friendly page"></a></font></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><br><br><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" bgcolor="000000" width="100%"><tr><td><table border="0" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="1" width="100%"><tr><td bgcolor="000000" background="themes/0ri0n/images/cellpic1.gif"><b><a class="pn-title" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=news&amp;file=article&amp;sid=28&amp;mode=thread&amp;order=0&amp;thold=0">Fun Fun</a></b><br></font></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="000000"><font class="tiny">Posted by <b>Tiberinus Maximus</b> on Monday, September 30, 2002 - 08:22 PM PST (4 Reads)<br><br>We went after Vindicator and handed him his ass, then we wanted to try Gozzrem again - see if we had it yet - nope - we needed a better mix of people - nice work all - we'll kill that bastard yet.   45% not too bad with 3 clerics and 2 wizards :D<br><br>
<br><br></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="000000" align="left"><font class="content">comments? <a class="pn-normal" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=recommend_us&amp;file=index&amp;req=FriendSend&amp;sid=28"><img src="images/global/friend.gif" border="0" alt="Send this story to a friend"></a> <a class="pn-normal" href="print.php?sid=28"><img src="images/global/print.gif" border="0" alt="Printer friendly page"></a></font></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><br><br><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" bgcolor="000000" width="100%"><tr><td><table border="0" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="1" width="100%"><tr><td bgcolor="000000" background="themes/0ri0n/images/cellpic1.gif"><b><a class="pn-title" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=news&amp;file=article&amp;sid=27&amp;mode=thread&amp;order=0&amp;thold=0">Not Much</a></b><br></font></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="000000"><font class="tiny">Posted by <b>Tiberinus Maximus</b> on Wednesday, September 25, 2002 - 06:42 PM PST (1 Reads)<br><br>Been doing some badly needed exp grinding last few days and killing named dragons here and there for the most part.    We'll be back in action again tommorow.<br><br>
<br><br></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="000000" align="left"><font class="content">comments? <a class="pn-normal" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=recommend_us&amp;file=index&amp;req=FriendSend&amp;sid=27"><img src="images/global/friend.gif" border="0" alt="Send this story to a friend"></a> <a class="pn-normal" href="print.php?sid=27"><img src="images/global/print.gif" border="0" alt="Printer friendly page"></a></font></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><br><br><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" bgcolor="000000" width="100%"><tr><td><table border="0" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="1" width="100%"><tr><td bgcolor="000000" background="themes/0ri0n/images/cellpic1.gif"><b><a class="pn-title" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=news&amp;file=article&amp;sid=26&amp;mode=thread&amp;order=0&amp;thold=0">More updates</a></b><br></font></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="000000"><font class="tiny">Posted by <b>Tiberinus Maximus</b> on Friday, September 20, 2002 - 06:38 AM PST (5 Reads)<br><br>Well, killed Vindi again - loot sucked.<br />
<br />
Commbat = Epiced - thats like 8 or 9 clickies now - all those clerics who have been patient with only rage remaining can finally feel satisfied.   <br />
<br />
Anyone who thinks they trivialized the cleric epic can yummy down on me right now.   Its the same fight, the same mobs and still requires that you are able to kill them.   Just the other day found Ixiblat roaming around Skyfire - obviously some guilds still cant do it.  Only thing is now guilds who can dont have to wait for an eternity to get something they are more than capable of or play stupid little games like random the Borg before they crash the zone.<br><br>
<br><br></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="000000" align="left"><font class="content">comments? <a class="pn-normal" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=recommend_us&amp;file=index&amp;req=FriendSend&amp;sid=26"><img src="images/global/friend.gif" border="0" alt="Send this story to a friend"></a> <a class="pn-normal" href="print.php?sid=26"><img src="images/global/print.gif" border="0" alt="Printer friendly page"></a></font></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><br><br><table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" bgcolor="000000" width="100%"><tr><td><table border="0" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="1" width="100%"><tr><td bgcolor="000000" background="themes/0ri0n/images/cellpic1.gif"><b><a class="pn-title" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=news&amp;file=article&amp;sid=25&amp;mode=thread&amp;order=0&amp;thold=0">WOO HOO on Vacation</a></b><br></font></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="000000"><font class="tiny">Posted by <b>Tiberinus Maximus</b> on Tuesday, September 17, 2002 - 08:10 PM PST (3 Reads)<br><br>But have had some time to play EQ in the evenings.   Some of the stuff we did this weekend.  Killed the royals.  Grats Eats on Blade from Queen, Seniah on Cleric Epic - click click, Barone on Cleric Epic - Click Click, Daralyn on Ixiblat, Tedd cleric on Ixiblat, Goataria on Epic, Ebonfyre on level 60, Elizium on level 60, Johad on Cloak of Flames, Ugak on Tigirs and Avatar, Me on 7/6 ID3 Talisemen, Ziggi on 7/6 ID3 Tailsmen, Promortem on 7/6 ID3 Talisemen, and I am sure I missed alot.<br />
<br />
Oh yes it is TRUE after 9 months, Dalriaden is now level 57 (was 56)<br><br>
<br><br></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="000000" align="left"><font class="content">comments? <a class="pn-normal" href="modules.php?op=modload&amp;name=recommend_us&amp;file=index&amp;req=FriendSend&amp;sid=25"><img src="images/global/friend.gif" border="0" alt="Send this story to a friend"></a> <a class="pn-normal" href="print.php?sid=25"><img src="images/global/print.gif" border="0" alt="Printer friendly page"></a></font></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><br><br></td><td>&nbsp;&nbsp;</td><td valign="top" bgcolor="#000000"><table border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="150" bgcolor="8c1818"><tr><td><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="1" cellpadding="3"><tr><td bgcolor="000000" background="themes/0ri0n/images/cellpic1.gif"><font class="topictitle">Server Status</font></td></tr><tr><td bgcolor="222222"><font class="content"><font class="content">
